%% Distributed order saga with compensation.
sequenceDiagram
participant Orchestrator
participant Order
participant Inventory
participant Payment
participant Shipping
Orchestrator->>Order: Start saga
activate Order
par
Order->>Inventory: Reserve stock
Inventory-->>Order: Reserved
and
Order->>Payment: Authorize
Payment-->>Order: Authorized
end
Order->>Shipping: Create shipment
alt [success]
Shipping-->>Order: Shipment ID
else [failure]
Shipping-->>Order: Failed
loop [completed actions]
Order->>Payment: Void authorization
Payment-->>Order: Voided
Order->>Inventory: Release stock
Inventory-->>Order: Released
end
end
Order-->>Orchestrator: Outcome
deactivate Order
Note over Order,Shipping: Reverse compensation
